Explanation: The array is already sorted.

Output:
```
public int findMinSubArray(int[] nums) {
    int minLength = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
    int start = 0;
    int end = 0;
    while (start < nums.length && end < nums.length) {
        if (nums[start] <= nums[end]) {
            start++;
        } else {
            end++;
        }
        if (end - start < minLength) {
            minLength = end - start;
        }
    }
    return minLength;
}
```

